  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Preview release of dependency-free SVG, HTML, PNG, JPEG, BMP, PPM, and baseline TIFF rendering for charts, visual blocks, report tables, metric cards, visual grids, wallpapers, and topology diagrams. Includes shared raster buffers, stream/file/byte-array raster export helpers, reusable image composition, static HTML grids and mosaic panel spans, expressive themes, dashboard presets, brand kits, font stacks, palettes, role-based text, grid headers, per-series and point-level data-label styling, point callouts, per-series legend visibility, semantic series roles, pictorial symbols, Isotype and people-infographic galleries, dashboard and word-cloud galleries, sunburst, pictorial, progress-bar, hexbin heatmap, reusable heatmap row models, wrapped/customizable pictorial symbols, custom donut center text/ring thickness, KPI rings, legend placement controls, pasted hex palettes, shared SVG/PNG compact number formatting, scoped inline SVG IDs, Native AOT validation, and fail-fast validation for specialized chart/topology data.",
